<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" type="device"><diagram name="High-Level Design" id="hld"><mxGraphModel dx="1460" dy="759" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1169" pageHeight="1400" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="lgd" value="LEGEND&#10;1–10 = runtime request path (top -&gt; bottom)&#10;I1–I5 = ingestion (offline batch)&#10;Observability &amp; Evaluation are cross-cutting&#10;Cylinders = data stores;  dashed = async / optional" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;spacingLeft=8;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="880" y="40" width="270" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c1" value="1. Chat UI (GET /)&#10;(👍/👎 feedback -&gt; POST /feedback)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="40" width="200" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c2" value="1. API clients (curl / apps)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="40" width="200" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e1" value="2. FastAPI endpoints:  POST /ask · /ask/stream (SSE) ·  POST /feedback ·  POST /session/reset ·  GET /health /ready /metrics" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="120" width="760" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="m1" value="3. Edge chain:  Request-ID middleware  |  Auth (API key)  |  Rate limit (memory / redis)  |  Guardrails screen_input  |  AccessContext from headers" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="210" width="760" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="o2" value="Semantic cache&#10;(cosine, skip under ACL / history)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="300" width="190" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="o1" value="4. Orchestrator.run / stream&#10;(dispatch by AGENT_MODE)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontStyle=1" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="290" y="300" width="300" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="o3" value="Session memory&#10;(memory / redis, TTL, turn cap)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="630" y="300" width="190" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="G8xUulkAOTxG3u--sGCq-3" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0.164;entryY=-0.035;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a1" target="t1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="200" y="470"/><mxPoint x="202" y="470"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="a1" value="5. Agent loop (tool-calling)&#10;LLM reasons + calls tools, loops" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="120" y="400" width="280" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a2" value="5. CRAG pipeline (LangGraph)&#10;rewrite -&gt; retrieve -&gt; grade -&gt; (retry) -&gt; generate" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="470" y="400" width="330" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t1" value="6. Agent tools:  search · lookup_fault_code · get_document_section · list_documents · query_cmms (CMMS connector)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="120" y="480" width="500" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="r1" value="7. Retriever.hybri